{'symbol': 'AFL', 'date': '2022-10-13 07:30:00', 'title': 'AFLAC DENTAL, VISION AND HEARING PLANS NOW AVAILABLE TO INDIVIDUALS OUTSIDE THE TRADITIONAL WORKSITE', 'text': 'NEW PRODUCT OFFERING PROVIDES COMPETITIVE RATES TO WORKFORCE INCREASINGLY ENTERING GIG ECONOMY AND RETIREMENT COLUMBUS, GA. , OCT. 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AFLAC, A LEADING PROVIDER OF SUPPLEMENTAL HEALTH INSURANCE PRODUCTS IN THE U.S., TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS NEW DENTAL, VISION AND HEARING INSURANCE PLANS, SPECIFICALLY DESIGNED FOR INDIVIDUALS AND FAMILIES WITHOUT ACCESS TO INSURANCE THROUGH A TRADITIONAL WORKSITE.'}